<title>FINLAND: NOKIA ADR ENDS AT $45-3/4 (FIM 206.84).</title>
<headline>NOKIA ADR ENDS AT $45-3/4 (FIM 206.84).</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-10-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nokia's A share ADR closed down $1-1/4 at $45-3/4 in New York on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Its Wall Street closing equals about 206.84 markka. In Helsinki on Tuesday, Nokia A closed down 8.00 markka at 207.50.</p>
<p>Valmet's ADR (two shares) closed down $0-1/8 at $31-1/2 on Wall Street. The price equals about 71.21 markka. In Helsinki, Valmet closed down 1.10 markka at 71.30.</p>
<p>Rauma's ADR closed unchanged at $18 on Tuesday. The price equals about 81.38 markka.</p>
<p>Rauma closed up 0.80 markka at 83.00 markka in Helsinki.</p>
<p>--Helsinki newsroom +358-0-680 50 240</p>
</text>
